{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "russian", "appid": 548430, "month": "2018-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1533081600, "end_date": 1535759999, "month_true_total": 14, "quota": 14, "returned": 14, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:38:38 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "44409271", "author": {"steamid": "76561198016313579", "personaname": "Scriber", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198016313579/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 116984, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 49, "playtime_at_review": 3030, "last_played": 1787167457, "avatar": "eadab8a2a48c78da0d48f729885d2b73c56eed14"}, "language": "russian", "review": "Мы идём во мрак и во тьму. Мы идём в логово зверя. Достаем мы девайсы во тьме, и взврывчаткой пытаем мы зверя. Миниганом щекочим мы пятки, а напалмом мы бреем лобок. На прокорме мы у гном-корпораций. Подавай-ка нам камни,сынок.   \n\nИгра абсолютный топ. Всем срочно-в пещеры!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1535383588, "timestamp_updated": 1535383588, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 17, "votes_funny": 38, "weighted_vote_score": "0.579455673694610596", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "44402798", "author": {"steamid": "76561198068676096", "personaname": "treSk*", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/errorcode999/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 5272, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 402, "last_played": 1709060956, "avatar": "0fb3f380a8205052a054e0f4341569c395a6c4d6"}, "language": "russian", "review": "Очень однообразная на данном этапе, но с большим потенциалом на будущее.", "timestamp_created": 1535355261, "timestamp_updated": 1535355261, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funn